  "charterS1Title": "First: Accuracy of data and eligibility",
  "charterS1Intro": "I acknowledge the following:",
  "charterS1I1": "All data and documents I have submitted are accurate, complete and belong to me personally.",
  "charterS1I2": "I have not used another person's data, and I have not allowed anyone else to register or use the account on my behalf.",
  "charterS1I3": "I have previously performed Umrah for myself.",
  "charterS1I4": "I am medically and physically able to perform the full rites of Umrah.",
  "charterS1I5": "I will update my data as soon as any change occurs that affects my eligibility to perform Umrah.",
  "charterS1I6": "I will disclose to Moneeb any medical, legal or religious impediment that may affect my ability to fulfil requests.",
  "charterS2Title": "Second: Integrity of endorsements",
  "charterS2Intro": "I acknowledge and undertake the following:",
  "charterS2I1": "I will only request an endorsement from someone who knows me personally and genuinely.",
  "charterS2I2": "I will not request or arrange any fictitious or inaccurate endorsement.",
  "charterS2I3": "I will not use the data of any approved performer to obtain an endorsement without their knowledge and consent.",
  "charterS2I4": "I am responsible for the accuracy of what I submit; endorsements neither exempt me from liability nor guarantee that my application is accepted.",
  "charterS2I5": "Moneeb has the right to verify endorsements and to exclude any endorsement that does not meet the platform's criteria.",
  "charterS3Title": "Third: Performing the Umrah",
  "charterS3Intro": "If I am accepted as a performer with Moneeb, I undertake the following:",
  "charterS3I1": "I will not accept any request unless I am able to fulfil it completely within the specified time.",
  "charterS3I2": "I will perform the Umrah myself on behalf of the person named in the request, and will not delegate it to anyone else.",
  "charterS3I3": "I will make the intention for the person named in the request, and will not change that person or combine more than one request in a single Umrah.",
  "charterS3I4": "I will enter Ihram from the applicable Miqat, then perform Tawaf, Sa'i and shaving or trimming until the Umrah is complete and I have exited Ihram.",
  "charterS3I5": "I will abide by the religious rulings relating to proxy Umrah and by the operational instructions approved by Moneeb.",
  "charterS3I6": "I will not confirm any stage before actually performing it.",
  "charterS3I7": "I will stop and notify Moneeb immediately if anything prevents me from completing the Umrah, and will not declare it complete when it is not.",
  "charterS4Title": "Fourth: Documentation and verification",
  "charterS4Intro": "I undertake that the documentation of the Umrah will be genuine and contemporaneous with its performance, as follows:",
  "charterS4I1": "I will document the required stages exclusively from within the Moneeb app, from their actual locations and at their real times.",
  "charterS4I2": "I will document Ihram, Tawaf, Sa'i and exiting Ihram according to the instructions shown in the app.",
  "charterS4I3": "I will state the details of the person on whose behalf the Umrah is performed wherever the platform requires it, to prove the Umrah is dedicated to them.",
  "charterS4I4": "I will not use previous recordings, photos or clips belonging to another Umrah or another person.",
  "charterS4I5": "I will not alter or falsify documentation, nor re-enact any stage after it has ended and present it as live documentation.",
  "charterS4I6": "I will not allow anyone else to carry my device or use my account to complete documentation on my behalf.",
  "charterS4I7": "I will not use any means to circumvent the location, time, camera or verification systems within the app.",
  "charterS4I8": "I consent to the app's use of location, time and camera to verify the Umrah stages while a request is being fulfilled.",
  "charterS5Title": "Fifth: Privacy and conduct",
  "charterS5Intro": "I undertake the following:",
  "charterS5I1": "To keep the data of the requester and of the person on whose behalf the Umrah is performed confidential, and not to use or share it outside the purpose of fulfilling the request.",
  "charterS5I2": "To respect the sanctity of the Grand Mosque and the privacy of pilgrims, and to ensure documentation never harms or obstructs others.",
  "charterS5I3": "To comply with the regulations and instructions issued by the competent authorities within the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.",
  "charterS5I4": "To communicate honestly and respectfully with Moneeb, and to answer truthfully any enquiry relating to fulfilment or documentation.",
  "charterS6Title": "Sixth: Liability and procedures",
  "charterS6Intro": "I acknowledge that:",
  "charterS6I1": "Submitting a registration request or obtaining endorsements does not mean I am automatically accepted as an Umrah performer.",
  "charterS6I2": "Moneeb has the right to verify my data, documents, endorsements and record of fulfilled requests.",
  "charterS6I3": "Any inaccurate data, falsified documentation, circumvention, or fulfilment by another person constitutes a material breach.",
  "charterS6I4": "Where a breach is established, Moneeb may reject the application, suspend or cancel the account, and take the measures set out in the Terms of Use and the agreement.",
  "charterS6I5": "I am not entitled to payment for any Umrah I did not fully perform, or whose performance or documentation is shown to be inaccurate.",
  "charterS6I6": "I bear legal responsibility for any forgery, fraud or misuse, and Moneeb may refer the breach to the competent authority whenever required.",
  "charterOathTitle": "The Oath",
  "charterOathBody": "I swear by Allah Almighty that all the data, documents and declarations I have submitted are accurate; that I have previously performed Umrah for myself; and that if I am accepted as a performer on the Moneeb platform, I will perform every Umrah I accept myself, on behalf of the person named in the request, completing all its rites until exiting Ihram, and documenting its stages genuinely from their actual locations and at their correct times, without lying, forgery, circumvention, substitution or delegation to another person, and that I will abide by everything set out in this charter. Allah is my witness to what I say.",
